WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.046 --> 00:00:02.867
Roxy arrived at Gem's Jewelry.

2
00:00:02.868 --> 00:00:05.289
Detective Smith was chewing a piece of candy.

3
00:00:05.290 --> 00:00:08.893
"You're eating candy, Detective?" Roxy said.

4
00:00:08.894 --> 00:00:12.226
"I hope you had some vegetables today too!"

5
00:00:12.227 --> 00:00:16.829
"Mrraah, mrraah, ramamgaah," Detective Smith said.

6
00:00:16.830 --> 00:00:21.868
"What?" Roxy asked. "That candy is stuck to your teeth!"

7
00:00:21.869 --> 00:00:27.849
Detective Smith finished chewing. "I said, ha-ha, Rocket Girl."

8
00:00:27.850 --> 00:00:29.988
Gem rushed over.

9
00:00:29.989 --> 00:00:32.997
"Thank goodness you're here, Rocket Girl.

10
00:00:32.998 --> 00:00:37.417
Someone stole my most expensive jewelry!"

11
00:00:37.418 --> 00:00:40.734
"What did the thief look like?" Roxy asked.

12
00:00:40.735 --> 00:00:45.831
"She wore a black cape and a pointy hat," Gem said.

13
00:00:45.832 --> 00:00:49.230
Roxy blinked. "She sounds like a witch!"

14
00:00:49.231 --> 00:00:54.089
Detective Smith nodded. "A witch who can switch one thing for another."

15
00:00:54.090 --> 00:00:55.910
"Huh?" Roxy said.

16
00:00:55.911 --> 00:00:58.522
The detective pointed to the display case.

17
00:00:58.523 --> 00:01:01.826
"The witch switched Gem's jewelry with this candy.

18
00:01:01.827 --> 00:01:05.601
But she didn't unlock or break the case."

19
00:01:05.602 --> 00:01:08.133
"Where did she go?" Roxy asked.

20
00:01:08.134 --> 00:01:14.861
Gem shrugged. "She disappeared around the corner."

21
00:01:14.862 --> 00:01:18.112
"Don't worry. It shouldn't be too hard to find a witch!"

22
00:01:18.113 --> 00:01:20.885
Roxy hurried toward the door.

23
00:01:20.886 --> 00:01:24.537
Roxy landed on the sidewalk a few blocks away and looked around.

24
00:01:24.538 --> 00:01:28.980
"Rocket Girl!" a man yelled. "Someone took my wallet."

25
00:01:28.981 --> 00:01:33.422
He held up something. "And switched it with this sponge!"

26
00:01:33.423 --> 00:01:38.096
"Somebody put a dog toy in my purse!" a woman cried.

27
00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:41.386
"And my new phone's gone too!"

28
00:01:41.387 --> 00:01:44.913
Roxy heard a loud cackle.

29
00:01:44.914 --> 00:01:46.201
She spun around.

30
00:01:46.202 --> 00:01:49.624
An old woman dressed in black was rushing away.

31
00:01:49.625 --> 00:01:55.541
"Stop, thief!" Roxy zoomed over.

32
00:01:55.542 --> 00:02:00.722
"Drat!" The witch scowled. "You caught me, Rocket Girl!"

33
00:02:00.723 --> 00:02:04.034
"Why are you stealing stuff?" Roxy asked.

34
00:02:04.035 --> 00:02:09.257
"You're a witch. Can't you use a magic potion or something to get rich?"

35
00:02:09.258 --> 00:02:12.827
"I'm Switch Witch," the woman said.

36
00:02:12.828 --> 00:02:17.066
"Switching things is my only power."

37
00:02:17.067 --> 00:02:20.741
"Well, stealing things is wrong," Roxy said.

38
00:02:20.742 --> 00:02:23.068
Switch Witch stamped her foot.

39
00:02:23.069 --> 00:02:28.258
"My sisters can fly and mix potions and turn people into toads.

40
00:02:28.259 --> 00:02:30.768
But my switch power stinks.

41
00:02:30.769 --> 00:02:33.374
Nobody ever notices my magic.

42
00:02:33.375 --> 00:02:38.538
By stealing stuff, I'll finally get people to notice me."

43
00:02:38.539 --> 00:02:43.345
"Sorry, but your switching days are over," Roxy said.

44
00:02:43.346 --> 00:02:46.414
Switch Witch grinned and stared at Roxy.

45
00:02:46.415 --> 00:02:49.337
Then she and Roxy both began to shimmer.

46
00:02:49.338 --> 00:02:55.275
"What's going on?" Roxy thought.

47
00:02:55.276 --> 00:02:58.066
Detective Smith jumped out of a police car.

48
00:02:58.067 --> 00:03:02.081
"Good work, Rocket Girl!"

49
00:03:02.082 --> 00:03:09.685
The police arrested Switch Witch and took her away.

50
00:03:09.686 --> 00:03:12.635
Roxy grinned. "That was easy!"

51
00:03:12.636 --> 00:03:15.200
She started to fly back to school.

52
00:03:15.201 --> 00:03:19.052
But she couldn't lift off the ground.

53
00:03:19.053 --> 00:03:21.489
Then she tested her heat vision.

54
00:03:21.490 --> 00:03:24.758
"Oh no!" Roxy gasped.

55
00:03:24.759 --> 00:03:28.954
"My powers are gone!"

